{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1340124-blessed-isle-lunars","id":1340124,"title":"Blessed Isle Lunars","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Lunar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-10-07T18:29:51-07:00","id":1340124,"title":"Blessed Isle Lunars","content":"I'm away from my books, but am trying to think of a Lunar concept. The basis being someone who Exalted on the Blessed Isle. So, what wildlife would be present that they could adopt as their totem animal? Any suggestions?<br /> <br /> Thanks, just dont have my resources at the moment","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-07T18:36:13-07:00","id":1340125,"title":"","content":"Bobcat in the North, or a Black Mountain Goat, Crags would be a perfect spot for Lunars to dwell and hide in the Blessed Isle.<br /> <br /> Or why not a Giant Mongrel Koi, aquatic Lunars could live in streams, lakes or coasts and they would have some interesting auspicious connotations, a carp lunar could even represent the bounty of the sea..","signature":"","edited":{"userid":754,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","user":"Eldagusto","date":".  spelling correction 10-07-2019, 10:07 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-07T18:38:44-07:00","id":1340126,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1340124-blessed-isle-lunars#post1340124\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm away from my books, but am trying to think of a Lunar concept. The basis being someone who Exalted on the Blessed Isle. So, what wildlife would be present that they could adopt as their totem animal? Any suggestions?<br /> <br /> Thanks, just dont have my resources at the moment</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, first, there's a ton of stuff imported to the Blessed Isle by Dynasts so they can put them in special nature reserves and then hunt. If those are viable for you then pretty much anything terribly beautiful or dangerous from the rest of the world would be appropriate. Otherwise giant pandas I think are Blessed Isle natives, maybe even native only to there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-07T18:46:20-07:00","id":1340128,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1340124-blessed-isle-lunars?p=1340125#post1340125\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Or why not a Giant Mongrel Coy, aquatic Lunars could live in streams, lakes or coasts and they would have some interesting auspicious connotations, a carp lunar could even represent the bounty of the sea..</div> </div> </div> </div>Nothing says &quot;bounty of the sea&quot; like a freshwater fish. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-07T18:58:06-07:00","id":1340130,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1340124-blessed-isle-lunars?p=1340128#post1340128\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Nothing says &quot;bounty of the sea&quot; like a freshwater fish. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yup no such thing as<a href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=salt+water+carp&amp;rlz=1C1CHBF_enUS866US866&amp;oq=salt+water+carp&amp;aqs=chrome..69i57j0l5.3782j0j7&amp;sourceid=chrome&amp;ie=UTF-8\" target=\"_blank\"> Salt Water Carp </a>alright...<br /> <br /> But I should have said what Bounty of the Waves instead? I just meant water jeesh...<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":754,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","user":"Eldagusto","date":".  spelling 10-07-2019, 09:58 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-07T21:22:28-07:00","id":1340152,"title":"","content":"They've certainly got deer on the Blessed Isle.<br /> <br /> Mind, it's more geographically diverse and less manicured now, so it's also home to things like desert and swamp animals.<br /> <br /> Probably done monkeys somewhere.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1340124-blessed-isle-lunars?p=1340130#post1340130\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Yup no such thing as<a href=\"https://&amp;quot;&#91;url\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.google.com/search?q=salt+water+carp&amp;rlz=1C1CHBF_enUS866US866&amp; oq=salt+water+carp&amp;aqs=chrome..69i57j0l5.3782j0j7&amp; sourceid=chrome&amp;ie=UTF-8&amp;quot;]</a> Salt Water Carp [/URL]alright...</div> </div> </div> </div>I was expecting something more.<br /> <br /> Would you not have followed any of the links on that page and seen what they had to say on the subject?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-07T21:38:03-07:00","id":1340155,"title":"","content":"Maybe some details would help:<br /> <br /> The character is a young daughter of the Empress, who Exalted after the disappearence when she was targetted by assassins from some dynast faction. She now leads peasant uprisings against the other Houses, convinced they are responsible for her mother's disappeatence and that they are destroying her mother's empire.<br /> <br /> Just needs fleshed out a bit more.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-07T22:14:22-07:00","id":1340158,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1340124-blessed-isle-lunars?p=1340152#post1340152\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">They've certainly got deer on the Blessed Isle.<br /> <br /> Mind, it's more geographically diverse and less manicured now, so it's also home to things like desert and swamp animals.<br /> <br /> Probably done monkeys somewhere.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> I was expecting something more.<br /> <br /> Would you not have followed any of the links on that page and seen what they had to say on the subject?</div> </div> </div> </div>You seem to be missing the point. You are being passive aggressive when I pointed out I used sea as short hand for water in general, and the first examples I gave were all freshwater and I ended with sea as the last example. The link I posted shows carp are mostly regarded as freshwater fish but they have one exception. It would be the same if I mentioned shark, which hey is a good totem choice, sharks are mostly regarded as Saltwater fish but they are not without an exception for freshwater tolerance.<br /> <br /> <br /> But hey I\u2019m sure that\u2019s friendly etiquette you display in real life encounters going all \u201cheh blah blah blah pleb\u201d.<br /> <br /> Let me personally thank you for contributing to the friendliness of the Forums for taking the time to dunk on a rando in a smug manner over actually making suggestions to the topic of discussion first. I sure that endears you to people IRL. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-08T01:55:01-07:00","id":1340178,"title":"","content":"Let's keep it chill guys, okay? <br /> <br /> I was going to suggest panda, but they're not very rebellious.<br /> <br /> What's her personality like?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-08T03:52:20-07:00","id":1340186,"title":"","content":"still working on that. I'm still early in the process (this is part of a project I'm working on off dand on).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-08T05:51:20-07:00","id":1340206,"title":"","content":"make it a crab - for epic crab battle!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malfeas F'Tagn - go check out my epic MLP/Exalted crossover &quot;The Scroll of Exalted ponies&quot; @ Fimfiction","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/588-webkilla","name":"webkilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar588_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-08T06:05:28-07:00","id":1340208,"title":"","content":"A Scarlet Crane, just to screw with the Dynasts","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24948-hamsandlich","name":"HamSandLich","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24948_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"161"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-08T07:01:06-07:00","id":1340216,"title":"","content":"&quot;Anathema with a strong claim to the throne&quot; is such a great concept I'd definitely want to lean into it. <br /> <br /> Maybe something dragon-like? Snake bird or something?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-08T08:07:26-07:00","id":1340228,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1340124-blessed-isle-lunars?p=1340155#post1340155\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> <div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252c2f\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">The character is a young daughter of the Empress, who Exalted after the disappearence when she was targetted by assassins from some dynast faction. She now leads peasant uprisings against the other Houses, convinced they are responsible for her mother's disappeatence and that they are destroying her mother's empire.</span></span></span></div> <div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252c2f\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">Just needs fleshed out a bit more.</span></span></span></div></div> </div> </div> </div> <div align=\"left\"><br /> <span style=\"color:#252c2f\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">\u200b</span></span></span></div> <div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252c2f\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">How might she get on with her niece Amatha?</span></span></span></div> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Elfive</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1340124-blessed-isle-lunars?p=1340216#post1340216\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;Anathema with a strong claim to the throne&quot; is such a great concept I'd definitely want to lean into it.</div> </div> </div> </div>I kind of expect &quot;becomes an Anathema&quot; to be to the Realm as &quot;becomes a Catholic&quot; is to Great Britain.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-08T09:18:31-07:00","id":1340242,"title":"","content":"Do you have some caste/moon already in mind or want to pick the totem animal first?<br /> <br /> That said, i would say that a small, possibly flying, animal goes well with avoiding assassins straight from exaltation.<br /> <br /> For some random reaason i thought of sparrows and arrows and got <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GJgDzu8_7rk\" target=\"_blank\">this</a> on my head.<br /> Hope it helps, if it doesn't, forgive me. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1147,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","user":"Baaldam","date":". 10-08-2019, 12:24 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-08T09:49:36-07:00","id":1340246,"title":"","content":"If you want to go with something unique to Creation which can reasonably make its way to the Blessed Isle, here are a few possibilities :<br /> <br /> Eight-Tailed Mole-Hound : Wolves with armored plates that can burrow through dirt. Sneaky with good defense too.<br /> <br /> Bloodworm : as disgusting as it sounds.<br /> <br /> Strix : giant forest owl that can grab people and fly away with them<br /> <br /> Hellboar : berserk boar that turn wound penalties into bonuses and trample their foe until they break their legs, opening them up for a finishing stomp.<br /> <br /> Raiton : tiny flying reptiles that behave like carrion birds.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25285-epitome","name":"Epitome","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25285_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-08T10:30:21-07:00","id":1340258,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1340124-blessed-isle-lunars?p=1340152#post1340152\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">They've certainly got deer on the Blessed Isle.<br /> [...]<br /> Probably done monkeys somewhere.</div> </div> </div> </div>There explicitly are gorrillas.<br /> <br /> ****<br /> <br /> Throw me in for River Dragon. Legendary Size. Dragon in the name. Synergises well with grapple charms.<br /> <br /> You can have other shapes. Slink about as a cat. Fly away as a sparrow. But your spirit shape is who you are.<br /> <br /> Who are you?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-08T13:04:37-07:00","id":1340285,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1340124-blessed-isle-lunars?p=1340228#post1340228\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I kind of expect &quot;becomes an Anathema&quot; to be to the Realm as &quot;becomes a Catholic&quot; is to Great Britain.</div> </div> </div> </div>Wouldn't that be more akin to a Realm citizen espousing Lookshy's Immaculate faith? All of the rancor of being thought of as an enemy of the state and pawn of a foreign power, but none of the monstrous ability attributed to being in league with &quot;dark powers&quot;!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-08T13:35:35-07:00","id":1340289,"title":"","content":"I think Isator's point was it doesn't matter if you're the daughter of the Empress, no Anathema may sit the Scarlet Throne. Just as even if you're the first and only son of the king and both your sisters die leaving you his only child... no Catholic may sit the throne of Britain.<br /> (Actually, when I visited the Vatican they had a monument to the uncrowned King James III of Britain, which kind of amused me.<br /> Second fun fact, we've recently changed the law so that now a Prince or Princess can marry a Catholic and still inherit. I mean, obviously a Catholic can't actually be King or Queen, that'd be crazy! So that's still illegal. But the Monarch can now be married to a Catholic.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":2402,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","user":"The Wizard of Oz","date":". 10-08-2019, 04:37 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-08T14:07:36-07:00","id":1340298,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Elfive</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1340124-blessed-isle-lunars?p=1340216#post1340216\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;Anathema with a strong claim to the throne&quot; is such a great concept I'd definitely want to lean into it.<br /> <br /> Maybe something dragon-like? Snake bird or something?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I considered that, still thinking of it. Too bad Pterosaurs aren't on the isle,that fit best.<br /> <br /> And if you like this version, you may like the Solar and Abyssal versions too (I'm making 5 ersions of the same character concept, one for each of the original Exalted types)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-08T15:30:37-07:00","id":1340311,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1340124-blessed-isle-lunars?p=1340289#post1340289\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Just as even if you're the first and only son of the king and both your sisters die leaving you his only child... no Catholic may sit the throne of Britain.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, I could have made how it was a point very specific to line of succession a lot clearer; looking at it now, I can see how it could read as a comment about being Catholic in Britain in general to somebody not already extremely familiar with that background.<br /> <br /> I visited the military history wing of the National Museum twice in the past week, questions pertaining to English domination are at the front of my mind.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1340124-blessed-isle-lunars?p=1340298#post1340298\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Too bad Pterosaurs aren't on the isle,that fit best.</div> </div> </div> </div>Are they not, though?<br /> <br /> Mind, even if they aren't native or never turn up from migration or whatever, I feel as though that's an animal for a character such as this where being able to pass unobtrusively stops being necessary.<br /> <br /> What are you looking for the Lunar in an animal native to the Blessed Isle?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-08T17:37:07-07:00","id":1340326,"title":"","content":"Aw, no love for lunar sparrows with their little arrows. Well, that's fate.<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Anyway, i agree with Isator's view that Pterosaurs (or whatever exotic one gives them in Creation) that pterosaurs are awesome enough to excusably migrate &amp; pop wherever they damn please. As an aside, a lunar's pterosaur warform might look a lot like a Pterok-type Dragon King, i guess.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-08T18:21:19-07:00","id":1340340,"title":"","content":"Pterosaur=Sky Dragons?<br /> <br /> Not much stating though. Smaller species would basically be birds, midsized like Pteronodon I'd use eagle stats for. So, how to do Auzdarchids?<br /> <br /> Btw, I'm starting to lean towards falcon or hawk, which were kept as fomestic hunting pets in medevil europe and I could see that as something Dynasts would do too (so they'd be around and common)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-08T18:59:19-07:00","id":1340345,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1340124-blessed-isle-lunars?p=1340340#post1340340\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Pterosaur=Sky Dragons?</div> </div> </div> </div>Or Claw-Wing, maybe.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1340124-blessed-isle-lunars?p=1340340#post1340340\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Not much stating though. Smaller species would basically be birds, midsized like Pteronodon I'd use eagle stats for. So, how to do Auzdarchids?</div> </div> </div> </div>Strix possibly. Or Hybroc, if you want to go for impressiveness over accuracy, i guess<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1340124-blessed-isle-lunars?p=1340340#post1340340\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Btw, I'm starting to lean towards falcon or hawk, which were kept as fomestic hunting pets in medevil europe and I could see that as something Dynasts would do too (so they'd be around and common)</div> </div> </div> </div>Considering how competitive dynasts can be in all things, i could see them getting all kind of exotic alternatives for hunting companios, from relatives of raitons &amp; mospids to pterosaurs to dwarf gryphons or whatever fancy pet they manage to get for extra uniqueness and attention.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-09T00:16:07-07:00","id":1340379,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1340124-blessed-isle-lunars?p=1340340#post1340340\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Btw, I'm starting to lean towards falcon or hawk, which were kept as fomestic hunting pets in medevil europe and I could see that as something Dynasts would do too (so they'd be around and common)</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, tamed hunting pets; those chicks had to be taken from the wild, they weren't able to breed the birds.<br /> <br /> Still, raptors of numerous sizes are found all over the world to be sure.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-09T18:10:45-07:00","id":1340529,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Baaldam</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1340124-blessed-isle-lunars?p=1340345#post1340345\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Or Claw-Wing, maybe.<br /> <br /> <br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Nah we call them Leatherwings fam.<br /> And I see no problem with Pterasaurs being on the Isle. Its a big continent with lots of Mountains and Valleys. They exist in my setting on the Isle, because there is a difference between governors ignoring Pteradactyls eating sheep and Governors setting up an Ambush to herd or Kill Tyrant Lizards next to the University.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-09T18:26:02-07:00","id":1340530,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1340124-blessed-isle-lunars?p=1340529#post1340529\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">They exist in my setting on the Isle, because there is a difference between governors ignoring Pteradactyls eating sheep and Governors setting up an Ambush to herd or Kill Tyrant Lizards next to the University.</div> </div> </div> </div>I dunno... I mean, dangerous predators have always been depicted as one of the responsibilities of local government in the Realm, with culling them as one of the basic heroic fears the Exalted can perform to endear themselves to the peasantry and ensure the smooth running of the state.<br /> <br /> Besides, in a country like the Realm, heavily stratified with an agrarian working class, most livestock has a key economic function rather than being for the sole benefit of unimportant farmers. Sheep produce wool, and wool is a valuable bulk commodity; they also require lots of grazing land and being watched fill time. Pigs are really your livestock reserved as peasant meat; they don't provide much else that is useful, they breed prolifically, they mostly look after themselves and they eat practically anything.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-09T20:27:58-07:00","id":1340535,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1340124-blessed-isle-lunars?p=1340529#post1340529\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Nah we call them Leatherwings fam.</div> </div> </div> </div>Fair pick i guess.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1340124-blessed-isle-lunars?p=1340529#post1340529\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And I see no problem with Pterasaurs being on the Isle. Its a big continent with lots of Mountains and Valleys. They exist in my setting on the Isle, because there is a difference between governors ignoring Pteradactyls eating sheep and Governors setting up an Ambush to herd or Kill Tyrant Lizards next to the University.</div> </div> </div> </div>Mountain goats might make even easier pickings i suspect.<br /> <br /> Now i would be most curious about how did a university end up near Tyrant Lizards' hunting grounds....<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1340124-blessed-isle-lunars?p=1340530#post1340530\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I dunno... I mean, dangerous predators have always been depicted as one of the responsibilities of local government in the Realm, with culling them as one of the basic heroic fears the Exalted can perform to endear themselves to the peasantry and ensure the smooth running of the state.<br /> <br /> Besides, in a country like the Realm, heavily stratified with an agrarian working class, most livestock has a key economic function rather than being for the sole benefit of unimportant farmers. Sheep produce wool, and wool is a valuable bulk commodity; they also require lots of grazing land and being watched fill time. Pigs are really your livestock reserved as peasant meat; they don't provide much else that is useful, they breed prolifically, they mostly look after themselves and they eat practically anything.</div> </div> </div> </div>True, but Dynasts are not everywhere and some of them have <i>priorities </i>- though some might certainly open room in their agendas for a bit of pterosaur hunting to unwind a bit.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1147,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","user":"Baaldam","date":". 10-09-2019, 11:31 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-10T00:20:59-07:00","id":1340572,"title":"","content":"There is a big difference between second editions stance that the realm extinctified all predatory and dangerous beasts to 3rd Ed\u2019s stance that the Dragon Blooded made the Blessed Isle more or less safe from being eaten by beasts as you travel but they still have wildlife reserves and dangerous forests you just don\u2019t go to. And I would imagine mountain peaks in particular were low priority in genociding all life they didn\u2019t agree 100% with. And not all pterosaurs would be an issue, some would be eating fish and animals hawks would eat.<br /> <br /> Essentially we have wolves still on the Blessed Isle, and tigers at least in some locales, so why not pterodactyls?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-10T03:20:49-07:00","id":1340589,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1340124-blessed-isle-lunars?p=1340311#post1340311\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I visited the military history wing of the National Museum twice in the past week, questions pertaining to English domination are at the front of my mind.</div> </div> </div> </div>Let's not get racist here, it was the Scots who first rose up to overthrow a too-Catholic King.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Btw, I'm starting to lean towards falcon or hawk,</div> </div> </div> </div>I think a falcon feels suitably aristocratic.<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-10T03:44:54-07:00","id":1340592,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1340124-blessed-isle-lunars?p=1340572#post1340572\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">so why not pterodactyls?</div> </div> </div> </div>So they can be fretted over and interacted with, not ignored.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-10T03:59:20-07:00","id":1340594,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1340124-blessed-isle-lunars?p=1340589#post1340589\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Let's not get racist here, it was the Scots who first rose up to overthrow a too-Catholic King.</div> </div> </div> </div>While the history of Scottish resistance to England has actually also been a subject I've been watching and reading things about over the past week, I'm not getting that from that particular museum.<br /> <br /> That being said, I've revised my thoughts on the matter. The question of the total legality of anybody who might fall into the line of succession is not completely irrelevant, but is still often an ambiguous enough thing to serve as a basis for competition over a throne.<br /> <br /> James Francis Edward Stuart didn't argue his claim before a court of law or something, he incited an uprising among followers who were motivated by a number of factors more sophisticated than &quot;we must respect the true line of succession&quot; but where the strength of one's claim to the throne is a basis for asserting legitimacy. Even with the Act of Succession, English authorities rested a bit easier when Stuarts nominally in the direct line of succession faded away.<br /> <br /> So sure, a Lunar child of the Scarlet Empress is probably excluded from the succession as a matter of course, and would be fiercely opposed by virtually any Dynasty and any devout Immaculate, there could conceivably by people in the Realm opposed to the established order who would see the benefit of pressing somebody who still technically possesses a form of continuity and legitimacy in the traditional structure, rather than a total stranger.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-10T08:41:27-07:00","id":1340624,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Baaldam</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1340124-blessed-isle-lunars?p=1340535#post1340535\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Now i would be most curious about how did a university end up near Tyrant Lizards' hunting grounds....</div> </div> </div> </div>You never wonder why kids don't run away from Pasiap\u2019s Stair?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-10T09:12:47-07:00","id":1340630,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <di